1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,059
Near a point source, wavefronts are spheres.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:06,536
Near a long thin slit, they are cylinders.

3
00:00:06,536 --> 00:00:14,049
And very far from any source, a small patch of a huge sphere is indistinguishable from a flat plane.

4
00:00:14,049 --> 00:00:18,072
That is why sunlight reaches the Earth as plane wavefronts.

